(text "The hub feeds the SHT45 (0x44), BMP581 (0x47), LTR390 (0x53) and SHTC3 (0x70), each on its own STEMMA QT cable; LSW.EN is SENS_EN, PA9 = D9 CN5.2." (at 226.06 74.93 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid db7d7d23-e8f7-5538-b3f5-a6008b3ecb2b))
(text "Power chain, mode A (daily): the BATTERY POWER shunt is open, the 100 ohm test load is fitted (guide section 5)." (at 226.06 105.41 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 0fccff0a-1a0a-5cb6-86e1-c7d6f2cb1d33))
(text "Leads off the breadboard: force heaviest, sense thinnest, each with its id (table below). A WAGO lever connector is one node; its pins are its positions." (at 226.06 109.22 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 3753a444-3e03-5b98-a683-a21a69e8b30f))
(text "Power ground (GNDPWR: pack -, charger BATT and SYSOUT -, load return, STAR) meets logic ground only through L_TIE. INA228 SJ1 (VBUS-VIN+) open." (at 226.06 113.03 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 011033a7-4b95-5166-8af1-3417853a1869))
